      "content": "i know you say it's a lie but it doesn't feel like one. it feels like a fact. everything i touch just breaks or hurts people. i've spent so much time trying to fix it but i just keep making it worse. it feels like i'm just taking up space that someone better could be using. how can you say i shouldn't feel this way when it's the only thing that actually makes sense?",
